{#- Magic bars & rice crispy treats sign (client 2026-10-29), apart from
    the dessert fridge sign: black & white, no logo, the price only. It is
    Dessert Bar's in menu.json, whose two kinds in Square these are. If you
    find yourself typing a price here, stop. -#}
{%- set desserts = (menu.categories | where("id", "desserts"))[0] %}
{%- set bars = (desserts.items | where("name", "Dessert Bar"))[0] %}
<div class="canvas sign sign--bw fd">
    {%- if bars %}
    <div class="fd-items">
        <section class="fd-item">
            <p class="p-display fd-name">Magic Bars</p>
            <p class="p-display fd-and">&amp;</p>
            <p class="p-display fd-name">Rice Crispy Treats</p>
            <p class="p-display fd-price">{{ bars.price | money }} <span class="fd-each">each</span></p>
        </section>
    </div>
    {%- endif %}
</div>
